spider-man has wondered most iconic  costumes in comics but he has had quite  a few different ones over the years  we've seen many variations in two  different movies and video games what  people might not realize is there's been  around 20 different Spiderman costumes  in the comics here's a top 10 costumes  number 10 future foundations when the  Fantastic Four changed her focus and  became the future foundation spider-man  joined a team the team suits were white  you would think that the white suits  would get pretty dirty quickly but they  were made of unstable molecules and  could also change color number 9 scarlet  spiders when Aunt May was on her  deathbed Peter Parker's clone Ben Riley  made his way back to New York  Peter was unaware his clone was still  alive then needed a costume to protect  Peters identity he went the simple route  by wearing a red bodysuit and a blue  hoodie with a sleeves ripped off calling  himself the Scarlet Spider he also added  some new items such as stingers that  could be shot out and impact webbing  number 8 Ben Riley spider-man when Peter  decided to retire from being spider-man  and enjoyed a married life Ben Riley  took over instead of just putting on  Spidey's old suit he tweaked the design  to make it a little more of his own  having the web-shooters on the outside  probably made it a little more practical  in being able to change the web  cartridges faster number 7 spider hammer  there's actually been four different  spider armors over the years the first  one was basically harden webbing and was  destroyed by the end of the issue  the second was bulletproof the third was  used to take on Doc Ock in the sinister  six  the fourth is his current costume and it  is based on his classic look number 6  stealth suit when Spiderman had to  figure out a way to defeat an enemy  without using his spider senses he made  a stealth suit that could warp the light  and sound around him it had a second  area mode that allowed him to avoid  sonic attacks  number five Miles Morales Miles Morales  was from the ultimate universe and  became spider-man after Peter Parker  died he was recently integrated into the  mainstream Marvel Universe and we now  have two spider-man's or men number four  superior spider-man Doc Ock was dying it  managed to insert his mind into  spider-man's feeling he could be a  superior spider-man due to his intellect  he made a new suit to be a better web  slinger number three iron spider  during the first civil war in the comics  spider-man aligned himself with Tony  Stark who designed a suit with colors  similar to Iron Man's original look this  was the first time Spidey had a suit  with extra appendages it had other  advanced functions but eventually took a  pretty bad beating  number two Cindy a costume on an alien  planet  spider-man thought he was using a  costume making machine he came into  contact with an alien symbiont the new  costume obeyed his thoughts and could  change its appearance  unfortunately the costume wanted to bond  with him permanently and take over his  body  spider-man removed a costume and had it  contained with the help of a fantastic  four honorable mention the bombastic  bagman after spider-man was freed from  the alien symbiote he was left with  nothing but his underwear the Human  Torch came up with a solution as part of  a prank Spiderman was forced to wear an  old and baggy FF suit with a paper bag  over his head  the top spider-man costume is the  classic red and blue one every time  Spiderman went through a costume change  he always ended up with the class  as he should let us know which costume  is your favorite  did we leave your costume off the list  answer in the comments below
 

